+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 The config search for a file starts at the folder that holds it, through the API and through --find-config-path (tests/integration/__tests__/config-resolution.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 --find-config-path on a path with no config file above it prints the error and exits 1 (tests/integration/__tests__/config-resolution.js) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Search from the folder that holds the file in loadPrettierConfig and resolveConfigFile (src/config/resolve-config.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Leave the file out of the invalid configuration message when none is given (src/cli/options/get-options-for-file.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/api/15363.md)
